	dcterms:description "Selective hydrogenation of cinnamaldehyde (CAL) over 6 Pd/P/Al2O3 catalysts (P loading 0-5 wt%, ~2 wt% Pd) in a Central Composite Design (27 runs) exploring temperature, pressure, phosphorus loading, and time. An initial fixed-condition screening (50C/5bar/30min, hot-filtration leaching test) gave CAL conversion/HCAL yield of 32/30% (Pd/Al2O3) and 45/42% (Pd/3P/Al2O3). Conversion ranged 6-96%, yield 6-90% across the 27-run design (catalytic_data.xlsx, 'Pd-XPAl2O3_CCD_CAL')." ;
	dcterms:title "Selective hydrogenation of cinnamaldehyde over Pd-P/Al2O3 catalysts" ;
