	dcterms:description "Selective hydrogenation of cinnamaldehyde (CAL) over 4 Pd/P/SiO2 catalysts (P loading 0-5 wt%, ~2 wt% Pd) in a full factorial design (9 runs) exploring temperature, pressure, phosphorus loading, and time. An initial fixed-condition screening (50C/5bar/30min, hot-filtration leaching test) gave CAL conversion/HCAL yield of 23/22% (Pd/SiO2) and 78/40% (Pd/3P/SiO2). Conversion ranged 12-100%, yield 9-56% across the 9-run design (catalytic_data.xlsx, 'Pd-XPSiO2_FF_CAL')." ;
